lla felice vita “precedente” diventerà il loro unico obiettivo."},{"language":"en-US","title":"Three Too Many","overview":"Suddenly and inexplicably Marco and Giulia wake up with three children aged 10, 9 and 6 who call them mum and dad. Getting rid of it and returning to the happy \"previous\" life will become their only goal."}],"images":{"logos":[],"posters":[],"backdrops":[]},"poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/kUdehyzniVTCupwxOt5zxHJWsec.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/g5pKwH0FonwUsiwXmyMrNQL1Jz3.jpg","seasons":[],"schema":{}}},"artworkLibrary":{"tmdb":{"schemaVersion":1,"source":"tmdb","id":870098,"type":"movie","originalLanguage":"it-IT","series":{"poster":{"it":{"status":"available","selected":{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/kUdehyzniVTCupwxOt5zxHJWsec.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/kUdehyzniVTCupwxOt5zxHJWsec.jpg","language":"it","width":1000,"height":1500},"candidates":[{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/kUdehyzniVTCupwxOt5zxHJWsec.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/kUdehyzniVTCupwxOt5zxHJWsec.jpg","language":"it","width":1000,"height":1500}]},"en":{"status":"missing","candidates":[]},"xx":{"status":"available","selected":{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/ipRnRw0X6xMSp632kIA5dmc4fe3.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/ipRnRw0X6xMSp632kIA5dmc4fe3.jpg","language":"xx","width":1400,"height":2000},"candidates":[{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/ipRnRw0X6xMSp632kIA5dmc4fe3.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/ipRnRw0X6xMSp632kIA5dmc4fe3.jpg","language":"xx","width":1400,"height":2000}]}},"background":{"it":{"status":"available","selected":{"type":"backdrop","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/xMLe1mHLK3vjf7Bn10ETUs9EkSt.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/xMLe1mHLK3vjf7Bn10ETUs9EkSt.jpg","language":"it","width":2000,"height":1125},"candidat